{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……唔、好困……”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3875", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿，你念书念到那么晚吗？”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "_ar6525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，通宵了。这次的我很有干劲喔！”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3876", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有干劲是很好，但是别在关键的考试时睡着了喔。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": "_ar6526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在不远处听到她们两人的对话。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定是昨天那通电话聊得太晚才让她这样。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，天羽学姐也一脸很困的样子……”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 394, "voice": "_ht1710", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐？”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，刚好在校舍大门遇到她。因为找不到熊喵很担心的样子。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 394, "voice": "_ht1711", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。还没找到熊喵吗……”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么，你知道了啊？我今天才听说这几天都没看到它……”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 394, "voice": "_ht1712", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以学姐的个性，一定是一直不停地找熊喵。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望它平安无事……", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，考试第一天顺利度过了。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，等一下你要做什么？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 394, "voice": "_ht1713", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“回家前我想去一趟社团教室。我也担心熊喵。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊，我也多注意一下吧。那就明天见了！”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 394, "voice": "_ht1714", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们挥手道别，跟隼太在教室分开了。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪已经不在教室里。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天还没跟她好好说过话。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然眼神接触了好几次。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次我们都会对彼此微笑。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵在吗？”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一打开社团教室的门，我连忙捂住嘴巴。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一个人坐在椅子上，趴在桌上睡觉。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "通宵念书让她在此时已经耗尽了体力的样子。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3877", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我尽量不发出脚步声靠近，把自己的外套披在纱凪的肩膀上。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然是室内，但社团教室还是很寒冷。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "差不多该使用暖炉了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不过，熊喵到底是去哪里了呢？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我走出社团教室，处理外面的作业。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总是在社团教室里活力充沛跑来跑去的它，消失这么多天不免让人担心是不是发生意外了。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最近真的变得好冷……”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我搓了搓手，走向兔子小屋。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "兔子本来就是很敏感的生物，特别是对环境的变化。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了饲料、水以外，也需要频繁地清理粪便，更换铺在地上保暖的干草。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且每一只兔子的饲料都有讲究，有些兔子吃了人类吃的蔬菜反而会拉肚子。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "实际照顾起来很困难。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只靠书本上的知识是没办法做到面面俱到的。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要快点恢复喔～”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知不觉中，我也变得会跟动物们说话。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连名字也没有的兔子们。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总有一天它们会离开这里。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我们社员也是一样。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明年美羽学姐就要毕业了，学园合并确定的话，接着就是我们从这所学校毕业。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到这里，就觉得跟大家相处的时间真的好短。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“得快点告诉她我的心意……”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想起纱凪的事。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想听听她的声音。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3878", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然，社团教室传来我正想听的声音。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了纱凪！？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3879", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一脸刚睡醒的愣愣表情。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平常看不到她这种模样，我忍不住心跳加速。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么嘛，是梦啊。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3880", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“突然听到你大叫我吓了一跳。是恶梦吗？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最糟糕的恶梦。以为是美羽学姐就抱上去，结果却变成新吾……”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3881", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我连在纱凪的梦里都出现了？”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……咦？这件外套，新吾的？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3882", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，因为社团教室里有点冷。考试期间要是感冒就糟糕了……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3883", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还想睡的话再多睡一下没关系。我就在外面工作。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“外、外面，喂喂等一下！”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3884", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪跑来拉住我的手臂，然后把外套还给我。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你该不会连外套都没穿一直在外面工作？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3885", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是没错，怎么了吗？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3886", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你给我差不多一点。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3887", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、什么！”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她握住我的手，不满地抬起眼眸瞪我。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你看，手都变得这么冰了！听到我这么说，你是不是要说‘女孩子身体冷到不太好’？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3888", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你的想法我全部都看透了！”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3889", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……但是我担心你感冒。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要管啦，另一只手。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3890", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没关系的。就算手变冰也不会死。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吵死了吵死了吵死了！欠你人情的我会死啦！”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3891", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪这么说，强硬地握住我另一只手。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "把她自己的温度分给我。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，新吾的手指好长。跟我的手比比看吧。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3892", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇，好大！这手是怎么回事，一点也不可爱。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3893", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是纱凪的手太小了。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼哈哈，是很有女孩子感觉的可爱的手对吧？”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3894", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，是啊。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3895", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你表情这么正经我不知道怎么反应啦。我是开玩笑的。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3896", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪用力握住相贴的双手，低下头。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使在分开后，掌心也一直感受到她的温度。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了。你在做外面的工作对吧？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3897", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扫兔子小屋。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你一个人能行吗？”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3898", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不然纱凪老师来帮我看看吧？”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，重做！”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3899", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连看都没看真严格啊。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“两个人一起做比较快吧。好了，去外面吧！”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3900", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 372, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪自然地勾住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说的没错。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在寒冷的室外两个人做比较有效率。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能跟纱凪一起工作我很高兴。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……理央，你睡了？”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3901", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“醒着。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "_ri0312", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“姐姐等一下要去社团看看动物们的状况。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3902", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你要乖乖睡觉喔。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3903", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不用你说我也会睡。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "_ri0313", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我走前先陪你去上厕所吧？要是姐姐不在的时候想上就糟了。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3904", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "_ri0314", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说那种话，明明还不敢一个人去～”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3905", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我可以一个人去。不要把我当小孩子。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "_ri0315", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好吧，你没关系就好。有什么事就打电话给姐姐喔。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3906", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“快点去啦。”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "_ri0316", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route04_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好，那晚安。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "_sn3907", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
